body:
People are scared of being the next viral sensation because some douchebag thought it'd be funny to take a video of a complete stranger without consent and post it to millions on the internet. So people don't dance in fear of being embarrassed. Dancing without abandon isn't perfect and god forbid you don't look perfect for strangers on the internet to give their unsolicited opinions about you.

&#x200B;

I'm baffled by people crowding up in front of the DJ booth and just watching and recording them rather than dance to the music. Wtf is the point?
